subdivide areas for proj rendering. for every side: for every edge: subdivide that edge. choose the new location like this: 1/3 * (avg of corners) + 1/3 * (extension of previous edge) + 1/3 (extension of next edge). if no previous edge or not last edge ignore and divide by 2 instead of 3 (or 1 if there is just one edge at all). 
